WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Channels” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Open Channels
From Settings & channels open Channels.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Review the channel status
The SMS card shows the status “Coming soon” in the current interface; there is no connection you can run from the card right now.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Follow the connection's availability
When the channel becomes available its options will appear on the page. Contact support to learn its availability for your account.
